# Portfolio Redesign — Priyank Khatri Style Clone

Redesign the existing Next.js portfolio to match the aesthetic and UX of [priyankkhatri.vercel.app](https://priyankkhatri.vercel.app). The reference site features a **dark-first, glassmorphic design** with vibrant blue/purple gradients, floating particles, scroll-triggered animations, a tech marquee, horizontal project cards, a credentials carousel, and a contact form with a social media grid.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Personal Data**: The plan keeps your existing data (`PERSONAL`, `PROJECTS`, `EXPERIENCE`, etc.) but adds new fields. You'll need to fill in your own details after the build. I'll use placeholder text matching the reference site's structure.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Color Scheme Change**: The reference site uses a **blue (#60a5fa) + purple (#a78bfa) gradient** accent instead of your current green (#059669 / #6ee7b7). This will be a significant visual change.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **New Sections**: The reference site has a **Credentials/Certificates** section and **Beyond Code (hobbies)** section that don't exist in your current portfolio. I'll add these with placeholder data that you can customize.

